---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { images } from '../data/assets';
const breadcrumbs=[{label:'Our Services',href:'/services/'}];
const services=[
  ['Trip Strategy & Design','Define the group, purpose, destination options, route, pace, duration, comfort, and support level before the itinerary hardens.','⌖'],
  ['Air & Arrival Planning','Coordinate or structure flights, common arrival windows, airport transfers, and the practical handoff into the trip.','✈'],
  ['Accommodation & Rooming','Match hotels, resorts, lodges, cabins, huts, or other lodging to the group and manage rooming assumptions.','⌂'],
  ['Ground Transport','Private vehicles, rail, ferries, local transfers, luggage movement, and the connections between each travel day.','→'],
  ['Activities & Local Operators','Coordinate destination specialists, guides, instructors, excursions, tickets, and activity suppliers appropriate to the itinerary.','△'],
  ['Organizer & Traveler Support','Help leaders structure trip information, participant questions, readiness, and the milestones that move a group toward departure.','◎']
];
---
<BaseLayout title="Group Travel Planning Services | Talon Expeditions" description="Trip design, flights, accommodation, transport, activities, organizer support, traveler readiness, and worldwide group travel coordination from Talon Expeditions." image={images.train} breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs} schema={{'@type':'Service',name:'Group Travel Planning Services',provider:{'@id':`${Astro.site}#organization`},areaServed:{'@type':'Place',name':'Worldwide'}}}>
  <section class="av-inner-hero" style={`background-image:url('${images.train}')`}><div class="shell"><h1>Our Services</h1><Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs}/></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="shell"><div class="av-services-intro"><p class="eyebrow">What We Do</p><h2>Travel Services Built Around the Whole Group Journey</h2><p>Not every trip needs every service. Talon Expeditions connects the parts that matter for the actual itinerary so the organizer is not left managing a collection of unrelated bookings.</p></div><div class="av-service-grid">{services.map((item)=><div class="av-service-card"><div class="av-service-card-icon">{item[2]}</div><h3>{item[0]}</h3><p>{item[1]}</p><a href="/plan-a-trip/">Learn More →</a></div>)}</div></div></section>
  <section class="av-proof-band" style={`background-image:url('${images.coast}')`}><div class="shell"><div class="av-proof-head"><p class="eyebrow">Supported Travel</p><h2>Clear responsibilities are more useful than vague promises.</h2></div><div class="av-proof-grid"><div class="av-proof-card"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><h3>Planned by Talon</h3><p>Trip design, organizer coordination, participant information, and the overall travel structure can be led through one planning relationship.</p><small>Planning & coordination</small></div><div class="av-proof-card"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><h3>Delivered with specialists</h3><p>Destination guiding, instruction, marine activities, mountain programs, cruises, or local operations may be provided by appropriate local specialists.</p><small>Local capability</small></div><div class="av-proof-card"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><h3>Prepared before departure</h3><p>Documents, equipment, fitness, activity prerequisites, rooming, arrivals, and final information are treated as part of the travel service.</p><small>Traveler readiness</small></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="av-process"><div class="shell av-process-grid"><div class="av-process-visual" style={`background-image:url('${images.packing}')`}><div class="av-process-callout"><h3>Start Your Journey With Us</h3><p>Use as much planning support as the trip actually needs.</p></div></div><div class="av-process-copy"><p class="eyebrow">How it Works</p><h2>One planning relationship, connected moving parts.</h2><p class="av-process-lead">The work shifts as the trip develops from concept and viability to reservations, participant information, preparation, and departure.</p><div class="av-process-topline"><strong>Make an Appointment Now</strong><a href="/plan-a-trip/">↗</a></div><div class="av-process-steps"><div class="av-process-step"><div class="av-process-icon">⌖</div><div><h3>Define the Trip</h3><p>Clarify the group, objective, timing, activity, comfort, and constraints.</p></div></div><div class="av-process-step"><div class="av-process-icon">▣</div><div><h3>Build the Travel Structure</h3><p>Connect route, accommodation, transport, activities, suppliers, and likely cost.</p></div></div><div class="av-process-step"><div class="av-process-icon">▤</div><div><h3>Prepare the Group</h3><p>Turn the plan into useful participant information and clear decisions.</p></div></div><div class="av-process-step"><div class="av-process-icon">☀</div><div><h3>Coordinate Departure</h3><p>Resolve final rooming, arrivals, documents, equipment, and support contacts.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="av-partner-strip"><span>Trip Design</span><span>Air</span><span>Accommodation</span><span>Activities</span><span>Traveler Support</span></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
